IO-53: list the worst link or node even when it is the first one

DefaultReportPlugin reproduced the legacy test `index <= 0` for the
"Highest Flow Instability Indexes" and "Most Frequent Nonconverging Nodes"
sections, so a model whose first link or node is the worst one reported
"All links are stable." / "Convergence obtained at all time steps.". An
unused slot has index -1; test for index < 0.

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply IO-53_swmm600.patch

